ValidationErrorResponse.description:
All errors responses should include:
request_id,
Connecteam error code and error message,
the url path,
the request body,
and error data which can be a pydantic class or a dict and should look something like this:
`{
    "error.path": "the gist of the error"
}`

for example if the user doesn't exist it should look something like this:
`{
    "user.id": "user doesn't exist"
}`
